@startuml
title Modele conceptuel metier - ConOps et OpsCon
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

package "ConOps - Problem Space" {
  class ProblemSpace
  class CurrentSituation
  class Stakeholder
  class StakeholderNeed
  StakeholderNeed : value_criteria [0..*]
  class ExpectedOutcome
  class OperationalEnvironment
  class ChangeDriver
  class FutureService {
    black_box = true
  }
  class CapabilityGap
  class FutureCapability {
    solution_independent = true
  }
  class FutureSolutionConstraint
  class SharedFutureVision
  class OpportunityArea
}
package "OpsCon - Solution Space" {
  class SolutionSpace
  class FutureOperationalSoS
  class SoSBoundary
  class ConstituentSystem
  class PromoterSystemOfInterest
  class OperationalService
  class OperationalScenario
  class OperationalFlow
  class Interface
  class Governance
  class OperationalDependency
  class OperationalOwnership
  class OperationalMode
}

ProblemSpace --> CurrentSituation : describes
ProblemSpace --> OperationalEnvironment : considers
Stakeholder --> StakeholderNeed : expresses
StakeholderNeed --> ExpectedOutcome : leads to
ChangeDriver --> FutureService : justifies
CapabilityGap --> FutureCapability : motivates
FutureSolutionConstraint --> SolutionSpace : constrains
OpportunityArea --> SolutionSpace : may generate
SharedFutureVision --> Stakeholder : aligns

SolutionSpace --> FutureOperationalSoS : describes
FutureOperationalSoS --> SoSBoundary : has
FutureOperationalSoS --> ConstituentSystem : composed of
FutureOperationalSoS --> PromoterSystemOfInterest : identifies
ConstituentSystem --> OperationalService : realizes
OperationalScenario --> OperationalFlow : contains
Interface --> OperationalFlow : supports
Governance --> ConstituentSystem : coordinates
OperationalDependency --> ConstituentSystem : links
OperationalOwnership --> OperationalService : assigns
OperationalMode --> OperationalScenario : contextualizes
OperationalService ..> StakeholderNeed : traceability only

note top of ProblemSpace
ConOps repond :
Why should the future operational world be different?
end note
note top of SolutionSpace
OpsCon repond :
How will the future operational System-of-Systems operate?
end note
note bottom
System-of-Systems appartient uniquement a OpsCon.
Aucun concept generique Value n'est modele.
La trace OpsCon vers ConOps n'implique pas
la couverture obligatoire de tous les besoins.
end note
@enduml
